<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Rewe takeover of Billa-EU source.</title>
<headline>EU clears Rewe takeover of Billa-EU source.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission has cleared plans by Germany's Rewe Internationale Beteiligungs Gesellschaft mbH, a unit of the Rewe Gruppe, to acquire BML Vermoegensverwaltung AG (Billa Gruppe), a European Union source said on Wednesday. The source gave no further details.</p>
<p>Billa, with 1995 sales of about 50 billion schillings, is Austria's biggest retailer with a market share of more than 28 percent.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom +32 2 287 68 11</p>
